    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.1",
      "text": "Almeno 400 g di verdura e frutta al giorno (circa cinque porzioni).",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "317d2c2d044768d8c6b79f5a6adb159835cb1227c5b29362d2484b07cc4c151f"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.2",
      "text": "Almeno 25 g di fibre al giorno (legumi, prodotti integrali).",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "a61294fbada9551c93d636476c77b2ac443c6a44519454ad19161fd7d0670a47"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.3",
      "text": "Zuccheri liberi inferiori al 10% dell’apporto energetico totale (~50 g), idealmente inferiori al 5%.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "ea701a30330e2c6f984f0052c957daba02b4c82db16d4a850386aab143f8f7bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.4",
      "text": "Sale inferiore a 5 g/giorno; grassi saturi inferiori al 10% dell’apporto energetico totale.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "690d697414fe9a56162431868d56862d6d6d735df57ba92b27f7015fe3224452"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.5",
      "text": "Per adulti sani che praticano regolarmente allenamento della forza, 1,4–1,6 g di proteine/kg/giorno rappresentano un orientamento pratico; in media, i benefici aggiuntivi si riducono nettamente intorno a 1,6 g/kg/giorno.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "bc8412661a241472e27724f9663f99d676a9131ed08f5fc3ab801db1049b354a"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.6",
      "text": "Fino a circa 2,0 g/kg/giorno è soltanto un possibile margine individuale in caso di carichi di allenamento molto elevati o di un deficit energetico mirato. Non è un obiettivo generale e l’età da sola non lo giustifica.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "e834d8588eec8f696328c371679723c7ae05b5372b1662ee29563a13e34e8fdd"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.7",
      "text": "La domanda sulle proteine rileva la regolarità con cui vengono incluse fonti proteiche, non la quantità giornaliera effettiva.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "4a2debb6e884717677330934ec73e1432e4da9b2941c20d56c6914744604ba2d"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.nutrition.point.8",
      "text": "Consumare più alimenti vegetali e meno prodotti altamente trasformati.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "3783877709f216a6995fc2a12ba25ccc61ae25e1b6b13cc8fbd312a82acf922c"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.card.3.number",
      "text": "3",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "9990fe18c755e44259245308aede547e0f80396e01adfd8f6f5ede3918e354fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.blood_pressure.title",
      "text": "Pressione arteriosa e prevenzione cardiovascolare",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "422fe0f86f4d112ff20c4d5cb1692c009784de4c1e463cbc3dd463da1e991d3f"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.blood_pressure.reference",
      "text": "OMS – Ipertensione",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "b7169c054062038a20550f2d3dfed8dab77c3852236da9f72c808ffe1f30a796"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.blood_pressure.point.1",
      "text": "Si parla di ipertensione a partire da 140/90 mmHg, se il valore è misurato in due giorni diversi.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "07bcf0343656dbc82cf103b27e1a8b172ee444f27ebd1fb2c282a30fabfff7a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.blood_pressure.point.2",
      "text": "Valori molto elevati (~180/120 mmHg) → tempestiva valutazione medica.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "d6d0400ea587bb025bc1ca08c4b875676f10ab4071ae1337602e99f16b078e3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.blood_pressure.point.3",
      "text": "Per le persone a rischio elevato, l’obiettivo è spesso inferiore a 130/80 mmHg; negli altri casi, inferiore a 140/90.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "5836c0387c5c9506a0334132846e917658edb57f26c0e1311521ffda25bfd2ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.blood_pressure.point.4",
      "text": "I cambiamenti dello stile di vita possono ridurre la pressione arteriosa; alcol: non più di 1 bevanda al giorno per le donne o 2 per gli uomini.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "decc0b0e4f8581fa9e5778b1f2e9d8c1378122964274c00b69c4e0ed6fabaa52"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.card.4.number",
      "text": "4",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "8892209899c7fed480a6cec225f8cfa37ba301c3c1a21bfce0558391eef182db"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.lipids.title",
      "text": "Lipidi nel sangue, ApoB, LDL, non-HDL e Lp(a)",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "b7cd6adcc3eeb115cf7a9eefb8e08102029ba3a1b84a7e24e04cab6469147250"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.lipids.reference",
      "text": "Consenso delle società mediche specialistiche (incluse le linee guida ESC/EAS sulle dislipidemie) · Fondazione Svizzera di Cardiologia –",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "d6534a76c97b1e999429348b19d2d0822b0264ba7fc55933e021d7884df05429"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.lipids.link_label",
      "text": "I valori da conoscere",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "592cb9b089ff942af0bd66db9151f545749fc484b9d64cf1901bfac95ce97a31"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.lipids.point.1",
      "text": "ApoB ≈ numero di particelle aterogene; spesso riflette il rischio con maggiore precisione rispetto al solo LDL.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "f0a27cbd60524823da0f29546c0bfbdf47232ac3997f75c0aad8686ebce36204"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.lipids.point.2",
      "text": "Colesterolo LDL: fattore centrale dell’aterosclerosi; il non-HDL è un semplice valore combinato.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "55f86250b9869ed20e0a78a259b45fcd9794ff36f868ddad2b61c8444c21e5d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.lipids.point.3",
      "text": "Un valore ApoB auspicabile è indicativamente inferiore a 90–100 mg/dL.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "50ab164052ebe070354fe2c2a787fba3e1c526a54e375091a6c2de645372efff"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.lipids.point.4",
      "text": "La Lp(a) è determinata geneticamente e di norma viene misurata una volta; è elevata sopra 50 mg/dL o 125 nmol/L.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "72c05b0311cb1cbe151b5cf79df5245167e500aceec3a7ce26d32f2877667bd4"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.card.5.number",
      "text": "5",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "9a3dde3c2b67edfd8d5fced8ec7957e59aa194c07c3bada1f2b91e1c4094b77a"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.title",
      "text": "Salute metabolica, glicemia e HbA1c",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "081741ccdd659d7dee2e40db0b4388319fcd5cdc400bbb0479a32dba5cc53232"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.reference",
      "text": "Criteri OMS/ADA per il (pre)diabete",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "9c023b7b1d0e63222356a680dcdbd1062dad4c0a327e3d52dd21ccf8ca44782d"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.1",
      "text": "HbA1c: normale sotto 5,7%; prediabete 5,7–6,4%; diabete a partire da 6,5%.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "a0c0178c409c7c3c46f9d6788fd6eddaa7af703c85b6ecad177bc3eb862edd5d"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.2",
      "text": "Glicemia a digiuno: normale sotto 5,6; prediabete 5,6–6,9; diabete a partire da 7,0 mmol/L.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "60bcbcae1d34daf603623f78ca831b5dae5ddf2e6a075cf530e2591e0dcd4125"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.3",
      "text": "Trigliceridi: normali sotto 1,7 mmol/L (sotto 150 mg/dL).",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "2e0424e317534f7d8cccc36efb23388468267e28ae5413b4b3c53de61bb95e17"
    },
    {
      "id": "sources.metabolic.point.4",
      "text": "Il prediabete può spesso regredire grazie all’attività fisica, alla gestione del peso e all’alimentazione.",
      "requiredTerms": [],
      "reviewStatus": "needs-review",
      "translationState": "translated",
      "sourceContractHash": "9d48a11fbdafd1adcb3118ec1e88ed2dc383e91998e923969b81e752a84df823"
    },
